{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat WORKSPACE.md && rg -n -i 'trust|prize|redeem|ownerOf|malicious|standard|transferFrom|non-standard|honest' DESIGN.md packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol packages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol\"","aggregated_output":"# Dependency Workspace\n\nCurrent working directory / primary repository root: /workspace\nWorkspace manifest: WORKSPACE.json\nDependency repositories are checked out as top-level directories inside the same workspace root.\nWhen reporting file_path for dependency code, prefix it with the dependency alias directory.\nPrimary repository: clean-context @ LOCAL_SNAPSHOT\nNo dependency checkouts are listed in WORKSPACE.json.\n\nPath guidance:\n- Reference primary repo files relative to the workspace root.\n- Reference dependency files with their dependency directory prefix, e.g. `agave/...`.\nDESIGN.md:2:Ethereum NFT raffle; immutable factory, ERC-1167 clones with immutable implementation. One entry costs 1,000,000 units of canonical six-decimal USDC. One purchase mints a transferable ERC721 ticket representing a contiguous inclusive range. Exactly one ERC721 prize is escrowed atomically at creation. Reserve met awards NFT and 95% sponsor / 5% treasury. Reserve missed awards 80% gross to winner, 15% sponsor, 5% treasury. Refund outcome pays 100% per entry and returns prize. Rounding is floor on aggregate protocol fee; remainder must be allocated without loss. No administrator, mutable configuration or upgrade. Request window [sale end, end+2days); callback accepted strictly before request timestamp+2days. Refunds open at deadline. Callback records result only. Settlement is permissionless, storage-only; redemption requires current ticket owner, burns claim atomically, and must revert all effects on delivery failure. Sponsor and treasury can claim independently after settlement. Never move assets between raffle clones. Quote token and Chainlink wrapper are trusted canonical dependencies; arbitrary prize contracts and ticket recipients are untrusted. Frontend discovery is advisory; transaction decisions must reread current chain state.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:13:///      bearer claim until its owner atomically burns it for redemption or refund. The immutable quote token is trusted\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:14:///      canonical six-decimal USDC with standard, non-rebasing, fee-free transfers. Supported prizes are honest,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:15:///      standards-compliant ERC-721s.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:22:        /// @notice The clone is initialized and waiting for the factory to escrow the configured prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:23:        AwaitingPrize,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:24:        /// @notice The prize is escrowed and entry sales or post-sale draw initiation are available.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:28:        /// @notice The reserve was met and the winning ticket may redeem the prize NFT.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:30:        /// @notice The reserve was missed and the winning ticket may redeem its cash allocation.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:32:        /// @notice Full ticket refunds are enabled and the sponsor may recover the prize NFT.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:37:    /// @param sponsor Prize depositor and empty-raffle cancellation authority.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:38:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:40:    /// @param prizeToken Standards-compliant ERC-721 prize contract.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:41:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the prize escrowed by this raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:49:        address prizeToken;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:50:        uint256 prizeTokenId;\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:58:    /// @notice Emitted when the factory deposits the configured prize and activates the raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:59:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the deposited prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:60:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the deposited prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:61:    /// @param sponsor Address that deposited the prize through the factory.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:62:    event PrizeDeposited(address indexed prizeToken, uint256 indexed prizeTokenId, address indexed sponsor);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:131:    /// @notice Emitted when the winning ticket owner burns the ticket and receives the corresponding prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:133:    /// @param winner Ticket owner that received the prize at redemption time.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:136:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 prize contract for `NftWon`; the zero address for `CashWon`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:137:    /// @param prizeTokenId ERC-721 prize token ID for `NftWon`; zero for `CashWon`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:138:    event WinningTicketRedeemed(\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:143:        address prizeToken,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:144:        uint256 prizeTokenId\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:173:    /// @notice Emitted when the escrowed prize is returned after a cash result or refund transition.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:175:    /// @param recipient Immutable sponsor recipient that received the prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:176:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the returned prize